\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces ConfigStream's evidence path. Typed snapshots enter the stateful processor; the processor orders retained versions by producer version, emits only justified adjacent edges, computes a deterministic semantic diff, and commits one manifest that separates authoritative Parquet history from rebuildable serving projections. Evaluation reads the same run evidence and reports correctness, cost, and diagnostics with their workload units.}}{7}{}%
